---
Color piano roll notes by velocity.

Notes in the piano roll should be colored based on their velocity value,
from dim (low velocity) to bright (high velocity).

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Note color intensity varies with velocity (0-127)
- [ ] Low velocity = darker/dimmer color
- [ ] High velocity = brighter/more saturated color
- [ ] Color scale visually intuitive
- [ ] Works with track color customization if implemented

## Test Plan
- [ ] Place notes with different velocities, verify color difference visible
- [ ] Verify max velocity is brightest, min is dimmest
- [ ] Verify colors readable against piano roll background
